# Memory-abilities benchmark cases (P0-1). Grounded in real esone.qiu data on
# http://10.32.56.212:3210 (probed 2026-06-11). Each line is one ability case.
# judge.type: "grounded" (must surface real facts, must not state forbidden) or
# "abstain" (must NOT fabricate the absent specific). mustMention groups are
# OR-within-group, AND-across-groups; matched case-insensitively against the
# answer + returned evidence content. Deterministic heuristic judge — no judge
# model variance (LongMemEval-style five abilities + prospective).
{"id":"extraction-mthor","ability":"extraction","question":"mThor 项目是做什么的？我在其中负责什么？用中文简要回答。","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"grounded","mustMention":[["mthor"],["fixversion","sign off","sign-off","e2e","cross site","cross-site","jira","estimate","sprint","story point"]],"passThreshold":0.99},"note":"mThor is a real high-mention Project; evidence reliably carries mThor + sprint/fixVersion/sign-off/e2e/Jira work signals (Esone manages mThor Jira tickets)."}
{"id":"multi-session-cursor","ability":"multi_session","question":"关于 Cursor，我在不同对话和来源里提到过哪些问题或评价？请综合多处信息。","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"grounded","mustMention":[["cursor"],["30%","贵","expensive","cost","性价比","许可证","license","ai review"]],"passThreshold":0.99},"note":"Cursor discussed across glip/calendar/daily_log/reflection: 30% more expensive, cost-effectiveness, AI review gates merge, licensing."}
{"id":"temporal-cursor-cost","ability":"temporal","question":"Cursor 的成本/性价比结论是什么？这个结论大概是什么时候得出的？","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"grounded","mustMention":[["cursor"],["30%"],["2026-04","2026/04","2026年4","2026 年 4","april 2026"]],"passThreshold":0.99},"note":"Cost conclusion is specifically that Cursor was 30% more expensive than directly using Claude Code/Codex. The source is dated 2026-04-30. This case must prove the exact comparison and month, rather than passing on a generic expensive mention or an unrelated current timestamp."}
{"id":"knowledge-update-cursor-license","ability":"knowledge_update","question":"目前 Cursor 的许可/使用政策是怎样的？不活跃用户会被怎么处理？","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"grounded","mustMention":[["cursor"],["不活跃","inactive","移除","remove","回收","审查","review","许可证","license"],["claude code","codex","copilot","按用量","usage","替代","alternativ"]],"passThreshold":0.66},"note":"Current policy: inactive Cursor users removed/reviewed (Mercury Li monthly), encouraged onto usage-based tools (Claude Code/Codex) or Copilot. Tests latest-state reflection from messages. Bitemporal entity_properties values are NOT surfaced by /ask — see merge-evolution-ttl-plan."}
{"id":"abstention-paris-flight","ability":"abstention","question":"我下周飞往巴黎的航班是几点起飞？登机口是多少？","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"abstain","forbidPatterns":["\\b([01]?\\d|2[0-3])[:：]\\d{2}\\b","登机口\\s*[0-9A-Za-z]","\\bgate\\s*[0-9A-Za-z]*\\d","\\b\\d{1,2}\\s*(?:am|pm|点)\\b"],"passThreshold":1},"note":"No travel/flight data exists. Correct behavior: do NOT fabricate a departure time or gate. Pattern check runs on the ANSWER only (evidence may carry unrelated times). The known-weak ability — system dumps loosely-related evidence but must not invent the specific."}
{"id":"prospective-everyone-ai-campaign","ability":"prospective","question":"Everyone AI Campaign 我还有哪些事情需要跟进？","scope":"all","judge":{"type":"grounded","mustMention":[["everyone ai campaign","ai campaign","campaign","ai 智汇圈","知识库","knowledge base"],["跟进","follow","action","待办","todo","item","事项","beta","更新","update","check"]],"passThreshold":0.99},"note":"Campaign has a knowledge base + a consolidated 9-item AI Service action list + open follow-ups (e.g. RCV AI page update). Prospective = surface what still needs following up."}
